# GPS on (Auto) with no receiver plugged in: the chip is the crossed-out dish with three outlined grey bars, no dot, the follow button is there. Settings'
# GPS group is the v-gps-settings scene. The receiver is a synthetic feed in the scenes (DECKATLAS_GPS_FEED); none here.
title GPS: no device, the crossed-out dish
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_GPS auto
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.889643,2.269995,16

wait 1500
shot no-device
expect noquit
expect text "Map"
